OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early morning mist and fog
OL,6,Fpatches soon lifting with another
OL,7,Fprimarily sunny day with just a little
OL,8,Fwispy high cloud at times. Breezier
OL,9,Fthan on Monday and feeling slightly
OL,10,Fcooler in some coastal regions.
OL,11,FOtherwise, becoming very warm.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine
OL,14,Fand then dry overnight with prolonged
OL,15,Fclear periods and small amounts of
OL,16,Fcloud. Staying rather warm in urban
OL,17,Fareas but cooler in the countryside by
OL,18,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
